        The rows store: `[batch, time]`.

      `decoded[j].values`: Values vector, size `[total_decoded_outputs[j]]`.
        The vector stores the decoded classes for beam `j`.

      `decoded[j].dense_shape`: Shape vector, size `(2)`.
